# k 'f r_ank x applies f to each rank-k cell of x (its last k axes; a
# negative k counts the leading axes instead) and assembles the results
# along x's other axes, mixed as m_ix mixes (A10): grade per row.
== SOURCE
M := 2 3 r_eshape 3 1 2 6 4 5
1 'g_rade r_ank M
1 'r_ev r_ank M
-1 '{ '+ r_/ _r } r_ank M
0 '{ r_ange _r } r_ank 1 2 3
2 'g_rade r_ank M
5 'r_ev r_ank M
== RESULT
2 3 1
2 3 1
2 1 3
5 4 6
6 15
1 0 0
1 2 0
1 2 3
1 2
6 4 5
3 1 2
